    ; can be right while two rows share an address.
    ; (2026-07-28 anastomosis reunion: main's line minted 888-893 — eurythmy,
    ; barnum, streetlight, autologous, pseudostructure, cargo-cult — while this
    ; line minted 888-896 for the KAT-Coder ingest and the work it opened. Both
    ; kept; main is the trunk so its ids stand and this line re-seated to
