    ; counted by hand — hdc-count over the merged rows is what set the 297 here.
    ; (2026-07-26 core-words reunion: + rows 880-883 — clusivity, deviance-
    ; normalization, non-strict, anisotropy — the four frontier words of one
    ; afternoon, minted 853-856 on their worktree while main's line was taking
