    ; kinesthesia, minted minutes later when he ANSWERED both after twenty-four
    ; days; his q701 answer aimed the camera at movement where the body had been
    ; aiming it at identity. Probed at 2822822887, then pinned.)
    ; (2026-07-25 gel reunion: + row 879 asemic, reseated from 854 — main had taken
    ; 854..878 for its ds4 line. Probed at 2742742879, then pinned; never the reverse.)
    ; (2026-07-22 fleet reunion #3: + row 878 deafarity, the min/max heal's row,
    ; minted as 853 on a worktree branched eleven commits back. Probed, then pinned.)
    ; (2026-07-22 fleet reunion #2: PR #366's 270 rows + this lineage's buildbound (876)
    ; and thawtax (minted 848, renumbered 877 — #366 had already seated constellation
    ; at 848 when it healed the 639 duplicate). Probed, then pinned; never the reverse.)
    ; (2026-07-22 reunion onto main: 265 -> 270 rows, max 869 -> 875. The 22 rows this
    ; line minted as 848..869 re-seated to 854..875; 26 earlier rows of the same lineage
    ; were already on main, so they are NOT re-added — the count rises by 22, not 48.)
    ; (row 869 coemit, Stone 30: IQ2_XXS on the GPU — its trained codebook has no
    ; independent implementation, so the device constant array and the CPU reference are
    ; emitted from the ONE same Form list, drift-proof by construction rather than by
    ; re-transcription. row 870 wraithcarry, Stone 31: the DeepSeek tokenizer — this body
    ; cannot build a byte-exact string of a byte >= 128, so raw bytes are carried as
    ; values and never re-emitted through the string type. row 871 lapspan, Stone 32:
    ; windowed whole-model residency — the 85 GiB file exceeds the device's single-buffer
    ; ceiling, so the model is covered by overlapping page-aligned views whose overlap
    ; exceeds the largest tensor, and every tensor lies wholly inside one.)
    ; (this summary line read 203/808 through two reunions after the pin below
    ; had moved twice — a stale narrative beside a live number, which is the
    ; drift this band exists to refuse. Re-read it on every reunion.)
    ; (union of racing same-day lineages: main's through 783 + a sibling's
    ; recension row, renumbered 768->784 at the reunion, + rows 785-802 from
